OL,3,GNEWSAUrgent treatment centre closes    
OL,4,Aovernight again                        
OL,6,FA hospital's urgent treatment centre   
OL,7,Fhas been closed overnight again amid   
OL,8,Fstaffing pressures, just six months    
OL,9,Fafter the measure was lifted.          
OL,11,FThe centre at Shotley Bridge Hospital  
OL,12,Fin County Durham will remain closed    
OL,13,Fbetween midnight and 08:00 until the   
OL,14,Fend of March 2027 over continued       
OL,15,F"difficulties" to staff the night shift
OL,16,F"safely and consistently", County      
OL,17,FDurham and Darlington NHS Foundation   
OL,18,FTrust said.                            
OL,20,FThe facility resumed overnight services
OL,21,Fin April after nine months.            
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
