OL,3,GNEWSAUrgent treatment centre closes    
OL,4,Aovernight again                        
OL,6,FKevin Earley, secretary of Shotley     
OL,7,FBridge Hospital Support Group, said it 
OL,8,Fwas "no way to run a hospital service  
OL,9,Fof this nature".                       
